<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-NATIONAL SHIPPING OF SAUDI H1 LOSS NARROWS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NATIONAL SHIPPING OF SAUDI H1 LOSS NARROWS.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			 (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net losses	   13.5    vs    39.8</p>
<p> Assets	     3,508.2   vs  2.882.3</p>
<p>Full Name: The National Shipping Company of Saudi Arabia.</p>
<p>Note - The company is 28.8 percent owned by the Saudi government.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
